====================================================================

This module's own code is MIT (see the repository LICENSE). It additionally
reproduces third-party TEST-CASE TEXT (a small slice of the W3C XML
Conformance Test Suite) whose copyright notices must be preserved in any copy.
Redistributing this module — alone or as part of zig-libs — must keep this
file with it. This adds no condition beyond MIT's own: it is the same
